<title>USA: Tengasco says wins leasing judgement.</title>
<headline>Tengasco says wins leasing judgement.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tennessee 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tengasco Inc said on Tuesday it had won a summary judgement against Eastern American Energy Corp for drilling lease rights to 647 acres of land in Hancock County, Tennessee.</p>
<p>Eastern American had held a drilling lease for the property, but under Tennessee law it had to begin production from wells to renew the lease beyond 10 years, Tengasco said in a statement.</p>
<p>Tengasco said a court ruled Eastern's lease was no longer valid because it had not met this requirement.</p>
</text>
